          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno kabaka me Icrael ki Yekocapat kabaka me Juda gucako cito i Ramot-gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka me Icrael owaco bot Yekocapat ni, “An abirukke macalo dano mo ata ka doŋ acako cito ka lweny, ento in iruk jorri me ker.” Kabaka ocako rukke macalo dano mo ata, ka ocito kwede i mony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo kabaka me Ciria otyeko ciko ludito mony ma giloyo gadigadine me lweny ni, “Pe wucilweny i kom dano mo matidi nyo madit, ento wucilweny i kom kabaka me Icrael keken.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ludito mony ma giloyo gadigadi lweny guneno Yekocapat, ci guwacci, “Meno aye kabaka me Icrael kikome.” Ci gulokke ka lweny i kome. Yekocapat ocako daŋŋe ki mwoc, ci Rwot okonye. Ci Lubaŋa okwanyogi woko ki bote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ludito mony guneno ni pe en kabaka me Icrael, ci gulokke gudok woko cen gubwoto lubo kore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dano mo otelo atumme ocelo ata, ci ocelo kwede kabaka me Icrael atura; atero obaro kin nyonyo me geŋo kore ki nyonyo mukene me geŋo kome ma obedo macalo pok rec. Kabaka owaco ki laryem gadigadine ni, “Lokke idok cen wek icikwanya woko ki i waŋ lweny, pien ret otyeko maka woko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci lweny odoko malyet i nino meno, kabaka me Icrael obedo ojeŋŋe i gadigadine kun waŋe okemo jo Ciria nio wa otyeno, ka ocako to ma ceŋ cito ka poto,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
